  "notes": "Everything lowercase. Three type voices: white bold tight grotesque, butter-yellow italic serif for keywords (1.3-2x size), and handwriting asides. ~25% of words are emphasised. Captions build into cumulative stacks and clear. Hero stacks pair huge white bold with huge yellow italic. Back half of each reel is caption-only (13-19 s stretches). Person-matte text-behind-head is used in the originals and NOT implemented here. Captions default to one word at a time (the reference reels are overwhelmingly single words); use captions.style.mode 'stack' for cumulative stacks.",
